an>1168793 08/07/2016 14:08:23<span>   </span>14<span>  \r\n</span>Jul</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">3 VR2W-123228<span>           </span>1168793 08/07/2016 14:08:29<span>   </span>14<span>  \r\n</span>Jul</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">4 VR2W-123228<span>           </span>1212923 08/07/2016 14:08:46<span>   </span>14<span>  \r\n</span>Jul</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">5 VR2W-123228<span>           </span>1212923 08/07/2016 14:09:39<span>   </span>14<span>  \r\n</span>Jul</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">6 VR2W-123227<span>           </span>1168793 08/07/2016 14:11:24<span>   </span>14<span>  \r\n</span>Jul</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I’m trying to summarize the relative frequency of each\r\nreceiver per individual within hour (HOUR) for each day (DATE). </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The requested output (let it be summary_df), would ideally\r\nlook something like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">head(summary_df)</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;color:blue\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">TransmitterSerial <span> </span>Receiver<span>     </span>Date<span>    \r\n</span><span>     </span>Hour<span>     </span>count<span>  \r\n</span>relative_freq</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">1168793<span>            </span>VR2W-123227\r\n<span> </span>08/07/2016<span>    </span>21<span>      \r\n</span>45<span>      </span>0.45</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">1168793<span>            </span>VR2W-885115\r\n<span> </span>08/07/2016<span>    </span>21<span>      \r\n</span>6<span>      </span><span> </span>0.06</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">1168793<span>            </span>VR2W-320024<span>  </span>08/07/2016<span>   \r\n</span>21<span>       </span>49<span>      </span>0.49<span>         </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">1168793<span>            </span>VR2W-123227\r\n<span> 